{"uid":"98597936075d5023","name":"test_withdrawing_a_draft_moves_it_to_withdrawn_and_keeps_it_visible","fullName":"tests.api.test_claims_crud#test_withdrawing_a_draft_moves_it_to_withdrawn_and_keeps_it_visible","historyId":"83d6ef8ed9d2118ce9488722e50c3c78","time":{"start":1789285022790,"stop":1789285022814,"duration":24},"description":"API-CLM-009 - **specification corrected by this test.**\n\n    The Phase 1 matrix originally specified ``DELETE -> 204, then GET -> 404``.\n    The application returns ``200`` with ``status=WITHDRAWN``, and on\n    investigation the *specification* was wrong:\n\n    * ``WITHDRAWN`` is a published value of the status enum;\n    * the list endpoint returns withdrawn claims and accepts ``?status=WITHDRAWN``.\n\n    A detail endpoint returning 404 for a resource the list endpoint happily\n    returns is incoherent, and it would also hide a claim from the customer who\n    withdrew it. Withdrawal is a state transition, not a deletion - so the row\n    stays, the audit trail records it, and the resource stays readable.\n\n    The soft delete itself is proven by DB-CLM-004, because only the database can\n    show that the row survived rather than being removed.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>API-CLM-009 - <strong>specification corrected by this test.</strong></p>\n<pre><code>The Phase 1 matrix originally specified ``DELETE -&gt; 204, then GET -&gt; 404``.\nThe application returns ``200`` with ``status=WITHDRAWN``, and on\ninvestigation the *specification* was wrong:\n\n* ``WITHDRAWN`` is a published value of the status enum;\n* the list endpoint returns withdrawn claims and accepts ``?status=WITHDRAWN``.\n\nA detail endpoint returning 404 for a resource the list endpoint happily\nreturns is incoherent, and it would also hide a claim from the customer who\nwithdrew it. Withdrawal is a state transition, not a deletion - so the row\nstays, the audit trail records it, and the resource stays readable.\n\nThe soft delete itself is proven by DB-CLM-004, because only the database can\nshow that the row survived rather than being removed.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_session_faker","time":{"start":1789285020838,"stop":1789285020907,"duration":69},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1789285020908,"stop":1789285020908,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"settings","time":{"start":1789285020908,"stop":1789285020909,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1789285020908,"stop":1789285020908,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1789285020908,"stop":1789285020908,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1789285020908,"stop":1789285020908,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"artifacts","time":{"start":1789285020909,"stop":1789285020909,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attach